    {
      "id": "claim_e07cc9ac336248478195691255a6c667",
      "statement": "The CLI surface for manifests: 'haap capabilities' prints a summary or the full build_manifest JSON with --show-all (never persisting capabilities.json), 'haap serve --speciality' feeds the speciality that the live well-known document advertises, and the registry register/search subcommands drive registry_client.register and registry_client.search with the declared speciality.",
